abstract: >-
  StateFork provides structured environment snapshotting,
  restoration, and concurrent forking capabilities for agentic
  exploration. It supports multiple snapshotting backends,
  including Docker, Podman, CRIU, gVisor, Firecracker, and
  Waypoint, enabling flexible and efficient state management
  for agents.
